  "description": "Line chart of monthly support contact rate (support tickets received per 100 active customers) for 2024. The rate falls steadily from 92.0 in January to 75.5 in November, an 18% decline, even though the raw ticket count rose 53% over the same period because the customer base grew faster. May is not plotted (ticketing-system migration lost the received count). December is shown as a separate hollow marker, not joined to the trend line, because only 20 of 31 days were collected; pro-rated to a full month its rate is about 74.7, on trend.",
